# Thousand-Year Storm {4}{U}{R}: "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, copy it for each other instant and sorcery spell
# you've cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies." Bot1 pays for it on turn 1 with two Black Lotuses
# (UUU and RRR), keeps three Mox Rubies and draws a Lightning Bolt each turn. On turn 5 the first Bolt is copied for no spell
# (none was cast before it), the second for one, the third for two - and the copies, not being cast (CR 707.10), trigger nothing:
# 3 + 2 x 3 + 3 x 3 = 18 damage, Bot2 from 20 to 2. Bot1 keeps the targets of every copy but the last, which it aims at Bot1
